[l_braz_por.land_facility]
Instalação de guerra terrestre

[l_braz_por.land_facility_desc]
As instalações experimentais de guerra terrestre permitem iniciar projetos de pesquisa relacionados a vários aspectos da guerra terrestre, como tanques especiais ou artilharia.

[l_braz_por.land_facility_plural]
Instalações de guerra terrestre

[l_braz_por.modifier_production_speed_land_facility_factor]
Velocidade de construção de §Yinstalações terrestres§!

[l_braz_por.modifier_production_speed_land_facility_factor_desc]
Modifica a velocidade de construção de instalações terrestres.

[l_english.land_facility]
Land Warfare Facility

[l_english.land_facility_desc]
Experimental Facilities for Land Warfare  allow you to start research projects related to various aspects of land warfare, such as special tanks, or artillery.

[l_english.land_facility_plural]
Land Warfare Facilities

[l_english.modifier_production_speed_land_facility_factor]
§YLand Facility§! construction speed

[l_english.modifier_production_speed_land_facility_factor_desc]
Modifies the speed of Land Facility construction.

[l_french.land_facility]
Bâtiment de combat terrestre

[l_french.land_facility_desc]
Les installations expérimentales pour la guerre terrestre permettent de lancer des projets de recherche liés à divers aspects de la guerre, comme des chars spéciaux ou de l'artillerie.

[l_french.land_facility_plural]
Bâtiments de combat terrestre

[l_french.modifier_production_speed_land_facility_factor]
Vit. de constr. des bâtiments terrestres 

[l_french.modifier_production_speed_land_facility_factor_desc]
Modifie la vitesse de construction des bâtiments terrestres.

[l_german.land_facility]
Standort für Landkriegsführung

[l_german.land_facility_desc]
Experimentelle Standorte für Landkriegsführung können Forschungsprojekte durchführen, die verschiedene Aspekte der Landkriegsführung abdecken (beispielsweise zu Spezialpanzern oder zur Artillerie).

[l_german.land_facility_plural]
Standorte für die Landkriegsführung

[l_german.modifier_production_speed_land_facility_factor]
Baugeschwindigkeit §Y(Landstandorte)§!

[l_german.modifier_production_speed_land_facility_factor_desc]
Modifiziert die Baugeschwindigkeit für alle Landstandorte.

[l_japanese.land_facility]
陸戦研究施設

[l_japanese.land_facility_desc]
陸戦の実験施設では特殊戦車や大砲など、陸戦の様々な側面に関する研究計画を開始することができる。

[l_japanese.land_facility_plural]
陸戦研究施設

[l_japanese.modifier_production_speed_land_facility_factor]
§Y陸軍施設§!建設速度

[l_japanese.modifier_production_speed_land_facility_factor_desc]
陸軍施設の建設速度を補正する。

[l_korean.land_facility]
육상전 연구소

[l_korean.land_facility_desc]
육상전을 위한 실험적인 시설로, 특수 전차나 야포 등 육상전과 관련된 다양한 연구 계획을 시작하게 해줍니다.

[l_korean.land_facility_plural]
육상전 연구소

[l_korean.modifier_production_speed_land_facility_factor]
§Y육군 시설§! 건설 속도

[l_korean.modifier_production_speed_land_facility_factor_desc]
육군 시설 건설 속도 변동치

[l_polish.land_facility]
Ośrodek wojsk lądowych

[l_polish.land_facility_desc]
Eksperymentalne ośrodki wojsk lądowych pozwalają uruchomić projekty badawcze związane z różnymi aspektami działań lądowych, takimi jak wykorzystanie czołgów specjalnych czy artylerii.

[l_polish.land_facility_plural]
Ośrodki wojsk lądowych

[l_polish.modifier_production_speed_land_facility_factor]
Tempo budowy §Yplacówki lądowej§!

[l_polish.modifier_production_speed_land_facility_factor_desc]
Zmienia tempo budowy placówki lądowej.

[l_russian.land_facility]
Институт наземной войны

[l_russian.land_facility_desc]
Экспериментальные институты наземной войны позволяют запускать проекты по изучению и разработке вооружения для наземной войны — особых танков, артиллерии и т. п.

[l_russian.land_facility_plural]
Институты наземной войны

[l_russian.modifier_production_speed_land_facility_factor]
Скорость строительства §Yназемного объекта§!

[l_russian.modifier_production_speed_land_facility_factor_desc]
Изменяет скорость строительства наземного объекта.

[l_simp_chinese.land_facility]
地面战设施

[l_simp_chinese.land_facility_desc]
地面战设施允许你启动与地面战各方面相关的研究项目，如特种坦克或火炮。

[l_simp_chinese.land_facility_plural]
地面战设施

[l_simp_chinese.modifier_production_speed_land_facility_factor]
§Y陆地设施§!建设速度

[l_simp_chinese.modifier_production_speed_land_facility_factor_desc]
改变陆地设施的建设速度。

[l_spanish.land_facility]
Instalación de guerra terrestre

[l_spanish.land_facility_desc]
Las instalaciones experimentales para la guerra terrestre te permiten iniciar proyectos de investigación relacionados con diversos aspectos de la guerra terrestre, como los tanques especiales o la artillería.

[l_spanish.land_facility_plural]
Instalaciones de guerra terrestre

[l_spanish.modifier_production_speed_land_facility_factor]
Velocidad de construcción de §Yinstalaciones terrestres§!

[l_spanish.modifier_production_speed_land_facility_factor_desc]
Modifica la velocidad de construcción de instalaciones terrestres.

